<title>NORWAY: TABLE - NORWAY MANUF OUTPUT ROSE 1.2 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>TABLE - NORWAY MANUF OUTPUT ROSE 1.2 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p>NORWAY TOTAL INDUSTRY PRODUCTION JUNE</p>
<p>(seasonally adjusted, month-on-month percentage change)</p>
<p>						   JUNE		MAY</p>
<p> Total output				  -0.3	     -3.0</p>
<p> Oil and gas				   -3.4	     -1.8</p>
<p> Manufacturing, mining, quarrying	 1.2	     -0.4</p>
<p> Mining, quarrying			    6.6	     -5.0</p>
<p> Manufacturing				  1.2	     -0.4</p>
<p> Electricity supply			   2.1		6.0</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
